  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "Adam R. Telle said the pace of change is accelerating faster than humans can comprehend and described a framework to integrate modern capabilities at scale. He said his job is to ensure Soldiers have the most lethal, dominant stack of technology behind, above, around, and ahead of them. He said they are making a \"huge bet\" on next-generation command and control, which he called \"the magic in the middle.\"",
